    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like everything is just broken beyond repair. even if i try, it feels like i'm just making more mess of it. sometimes i sit there thinking that maybe the only way to actually stop the hurting—for me and for them—is if I just wasn't a part of it anymore. like, if the mistake was just gone, maybe they could finally have peace and look back at their lives without seeing my mess everywhere.",
